# Java & PostgreSQL Relational Database Application

## Project Overview
   This project began as Standalone Java Command -line interface (my-modern-java-playlist)
   built using ** JDK21** and managed via **Maven** menu system, I integrated a robust **PostgreSQL**
   relational database backend.

   By bridging these two ecosystems together via a secure JDBC pipeline,this application has evolved into a
   fully operational ** Relational Database Management Tool**.
   It provides a comprehensive, interactive dashboard to manage and persist data entries in real-time.

   ## Key Technical Milestones & Features
   * ** Full CRUD Integration: ** Features dedicated Methods for Creating data streams.Reading/Filtering
   active records, Updating attributes and executing precise Deletions by target ID numbers.

   * ** Flexible Pattern Searching** Leverages the PostgreSQL ILIKE operator and parameter wildcards(%)
   to execute case-insensitive query filters across multiple text Columns simultaneously.

  * ** Data Integrity & Security ** Built entirely using PreparedStatement parameterized queries to ensure
      absolute protection against SQL Injection vulnerabilities .

  * **  Defensive Resource Management **  Implements nested try-with-resources blocks to ensure automatic
        database connection closures, preventing server side memory leaks.

  ## Tech Stack
    * ** Language : ** Java (JDK 21)
    * ** Build Tool: ** Maven
    * ** Database: ** PostgreSQL 18
    * ** Driver: ** PostgreSQL JDBC Driver (42.x)
